  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Utvecklingsl&#xe4;nders deltagande i internationella f&#xf6;rhandlingar om ett nytt globalt avtal mot plastf&#xf6;roreningar (INC 2), SAICM sekretariatet, sektretariet f&#xf6;r Special Programme on Institutional Strengthening for the Chemicals and Waste Cluster, Basel-, Rotterdam- och Stockholmskonventionernas (BRS) sekretariat, One Planet Network, Minimatakonventionens sekretariat och Montrealprotokollet</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">participation of developing countries towards a global agreement on plastic pollution, the SAICM Secretariat, the Secretariat for Special Programme on Institutional Strengthening for the Chemicals and Waste Cluster, the Secretariat of the Basel, Rotterdam and Stockholm Conventions, the One Planet Network, the Secretariat of the Minamata Convention, and the Montreal Protocol.</narrative>
  </description>
